1b:T91a,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"飞鸟云和飞鸟机场是一家吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"不是。飞鸟云（feiniaoyun）是直连机场、Hysteria2 协议、1 元/月起；飞鸟机场（FlyingBird）是 IPLC 专线、SS 协议、¥15/100G 起。两家完全无关，别买错。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"飞鸟云跑路了吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"没有。运营约 5 年，持续更新公告、维护 TG 群。「用不了」多是直连节点被墙，按官方排查（更新订阅→换客户端→切流量→开 IPv6）即可，非跑路。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"飞鸟云怎么样？安全吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"极致低价的直连老站，协议新、不限速不限设备；但需自己折腾、节点常被墙。作为直连机场遵循通用安全原则：不在挂代理时登录重要账号、用独立密码。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"飞鸟云为什么 4 月没被封？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"4 月那波封锁主要针对中转机场，飞鸟云是纯直连（AWS 海外节点），避开了这一特征，所以官方称未受影响。这也是它适合做「异构备用」的原因。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"飞鸟云哪个套餐划算？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"月付 600G/¥20（¥0.033/GB）单价最低；长期留号选传家宝年付（1 元/月）；用量飘忽或当备用选永不过期流量包（可叠加）。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"飞鸟云官网/最新地址在哪？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"域名常换，认准官方 GitHub 防失联页和 TG 群获取最新地址，别收藏旧域名，谨防同名仿冒站。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"飞鸟云节点全部超时怎么办？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"先更新订阅到最新→切换 WiFi/手机流量→开启 IPv6→下载官网最新客户端（旧客户端节点不全）。仍不行联系官网右下角客服。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"飞鸟云支持哪些客户端？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"用官网教程指定的、支持 Hysteria2/VLESS 的客户端；官方不推荐 v2ray、sing-box；导入报错先做订阅转换。"}}]}11:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-12","children":["$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a",["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1b"}}],["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"my-6 border-l-2 border-accent bg-card py-3 pr-3 pl-4 font-serif text-lg leading-8 text-foreground/85 not-italic","children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"30 秒结论"}]}],["$","$1","1",{"children":"：飞鸟云（feiniaoyun）是一家运营约 5 年的"}],["$","$1","2",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"极致低价直连机场"}]}],["$","$1","3",{"children":"：年付 12 元起（合 1 元/月）、不限速、不限设备数、支持最新 "}],["$","$1","4",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"Hysteria2 / VLESS 协议"}]}],["$","$1","5",{"children":"，节点为海外 AWS 直连（美日新台港），包月／年付／永不过期流量包全都有。它有一个反直觉的当下优势："}],["$","$1","6",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"2026 年 4 月那波针对中转机场的封锁，它作为纯直连机场反而没受影响"}]}],["$","$1","7",{"children":"。代价是直连机场的老问题——节点会被不定时墙、需要勤换订阅、要自己会配置。"}],["$","$1","8",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"适合预算极低、能折腾、要备用梯子的人；明确不适合要专线稳定、看教程都嫌烦的小白"}]}],["$","$1","9",{"children":"（官方原话：「看不懂教程不要买，购买后不退款」）。"}]]}],"\n"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":["$","em",null,{"className":"text-[0.95em] text-muted not-italic","children":"核实日期：2026-06-12 ｜ 当前状态：正常运营，未跑路（运营约 5 年；4 月封锁潮中直连节点未受波及）"}]}],["$","hr",null,{"className":"my-10 border-rule"}],["$L1c",["$","h2",null,{"id":"先消歧-飞鸟云-飞鸟机场","className":"mt-12 mb-4 scroll-mt-28 border-b border-rule pb-2 font-serif text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight lg:scroll-mt-20","children":"⚠️ 先消歧：飞鸟云 ≠ 飞鸟机场"}]],["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["本文说的飞鸟云（feiniaoyun），和站内另一家叫",["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/pianyijichang/feiniaojichang","className":"text-accent hover:underline","children":"飞鸟机场"}],"的服务"]}],["$","$1","1",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"完全无关"}]}],["$","$1","2",{"children":"——名字像，却是两套不同的东西，买错了概不退款，务必分清："}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"table-scroll -mx-6 my-6 overflow-x-auto px-6 sm:mx-0 sm:px-0","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full min-w-[30rem] border-collapse text-left text-sm","children":["$L1d","$L1e"]}]}],"$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","