5c:["$","h4",null,{"className":"mt-6 mb-2 font-serif text-base font-semibold tracking-tight","children":"飞鸟云和飞鸟机场是一家吗？"}]
5d:["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":"不是。飞鸟云（feiniaoyun）是直连机场、Hysteria2 协议、1 元/月起；飞鸟机场（FlyingBird）是 IPLC 专线、SS 协议、¥15/100G 起。两家完全无关，别买错。"}]
5e:["$","h4",null,{"className":"mt-6 mb-2 font-serif text-base font-semibold tracking-tight","children":"飞鸟云跑路了吗？"}]
5f:["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":"没有。运营约 5 年，持续更新公告、维护 TG 群。「用不了」多是直连节点被墙，按官方排查（更新订阅→换客户端→切流量→开 IPv6）即可，非跑路。"}]
60:["$","h4",null,{"className":"mt-6 mb-2 font-serif text-base font-semibold tracking-tight","children":"飞鸟云怎么样？安全吗？"}]
61:["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":"极致低价的直连老站，协议新、不限速不限设备；但需自己折腾、节点常被墙。作为直连机场遵循通用安全原则：不在挂代理时登录重要账号、用独立密码。"}]
62:["$","h4",null,{"className":"mt-6 mb-2 font-serif text-base font-semibold tracking-tight","children":"飞鸟云为什么 4 月没被封？"}]
63:["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":"4 月那波封锁主要针对中转机场，飞鸟云是纯直连（AWS 海外节点），避开了这一特征，所以官方称未受影响。这也是它适合做「异构备用」的原因。"}]
64:["$","h4",null,{"className":"mt-6 mb-2 font-serif text-base font-semibold tracking-tight","children":"飞鸟云哪个套餐划算？"}]
65:["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":"月付 600G/¥20（¥0.033/GB）单价最低；长期留号选传家宝年付（1 元/月）；用量飘忽或当备用选永不过期流量包（可叠加）。"}]
66:["$","h4",null,{"className":"mt-6 mb-2 font-serif text-base font-semibold tracking-tight","children":"飞鸟云官网/最新地址在哪？"}]
67:["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":"域名常换，认准官方 GitHub 防失联页和 TG 群获取最新地址，别收藏旧域名，谨防同名仿冒站。"}]
68:["$","h4",null,{"className":"mt-6 mb-2 font-serif text-base font-semibold tracking-tight","children":"飞鸟云节点全部超时怎么办？"}]
69:["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":"先更新订阅到最新→切换 WiFi／手机流量→开启 IPv6→下载官网最新客户端（旧客户端节点不全）。仍不行联系官网右下角客服。"}]
6a:["$","h4",null,{"className":"mt-6 mb-2 font-serif text-base font-semibold tracking-tight","children":"飞鸟云支持哪些客户端？"}]
